{"title":"Reincarnation Of The Fist King","synopsis":"[ Dari penulis yang menghadirkanmu The Return of the Crazy Demon! ]\n\nDan Woosung, seorang pria yang pernah menjelajahi dunia murim hanya mengandalkan tinjunya, menemui ajal mendadak di tangan faksi iblis.\n\nNamun, ia terbangun kembali dalam tubuh putra sulung dari keluarga pedagang kaya bernama Eunha.\n\n\"Aku tidak mencari kebebasan dari utang atau dendam. Utang harus dibayar. Dan dendam harus dibalas.\"\n\nMeski tubuh barunya hanya menawarkan kekayaan, Dan Woosung bangkit kembali.\n\nDia didukung oleh harta melimpah dan kemampuan bela diri dari kehidupan sebelumnya.\n\nDan saat ini dia kembali menapaki jalan balas dendam.","alternative_title":"권왕환생","author":"Yu Jin Sung, Seungtu","artist":"Donuts","genres":["Action","Adventure","Fantasy","Murim"],"chapters":[{"id":"c6683e6c-2b26-4e5f-97a2-7f10cf517ea8","number":"63","title":"Chapter 63","date":"2026-08-02","images":[]},{"id":"ad0f841d-84ae-4498-8ead-07ba2d47a32c","number":"62","title":"Chapter 62","date":"2026-07-26","images":[]},{"id":"a13d3ce0-b868-4bca-af22-014ff10930fe","number":"61","title":"Chapter 61","date":"2026-07-19","images":[]},{"id":"af696f98-8711-48c4-bf07-aa4f958de415","number":"60","title":"Chapter 60","date":"2026-07-12","images":[]},{"id":"ad5fd73e-9dc6-4178-9f89-90b606a7835d","number":"59","title":"Chapter 59","date":"2026-07-05","images":[]},{"id":"54bb7125-787d-4a9e-a1c1-ab6d214f4b51","number":"58","title":"Chapter 58","date":"2026-06-29","images":[]},{"id":"709a52df-1ca4-4a72-87c4-cce758301bab","number":"57","title":"Chapter 57","date":"2026-06-22","images":[]},{"id":"d31e674b-f645-447c-b6c0-9184f150b461","number":"56","title":"Chapter 56","date":"2026-06-14","images":[]},{"id":"053fa8cc-2ac0-49bc-89a8-e1ccbdde3d6c","number":"55","title":"Chapter 55","date":"2026-05-31","images":[]},{"id":"18fdd4fa-a5df-4cf8-ac3a-5fa743585c29","number":"54","title":"Chapter 54","date":"2026-05-24","images":[]},{"id":"1ae990a4-5782-497b-bcc7-3d5ad35dad